text: >-
  UT TIME

  EVENT

  NOTES

  Sept 11

  12:25 PM BIG BANG

  12:39 PM FBI assets were on the scene (Kosh Patel)

  *1014 just northeast of the Lossee building. Forensics has recovered a
  weapon...the forensics team has located

  a weapon just across the street from Lot [Mike?] 20 near the Lossee building.

  5:40 PM Radio says they found a weapon near Losee Center

  Press conference (Beau Mason) // Weapon found "high powered rifle"... Not
  releasing video footage at this time,

  7:00 AM working through technologies to identify suspic... will release to
  media if unsuccessful

  9:58 AM First set of FBI photos released

  10:44 AM FBI announces $100k prize for tips leading to an arrest

  5:00 PM Kash and deputy arrive on scene in Utah

  5:01 PM CNN Erin Burnett says "rapid developments" in CK case

  5:30 PM AFZ lands in Phoenix w/ CK body

  6:17 PM Additional photos released by FBI

  6:25 PM Possibly already in custody?... (*6:25pm* Miranda timestamp on court
  docs)

  Several hours before alleged arrest time

  Authorities/Patel •> press conference... show new photos and video of the
  suspect. He also says Utah is

  preparing affidavits to pursue the death penalty for when the suspect is
  caught.

  Washington County Sheriff Nate Brooksby receives a phone call from a retired
  deputy friend... deputy informs

  8:02 PM Brooksby he knows the shooter and that he is in Washington County.

  8:04 PM Brooksby <> Friend phone call ends

  8:05 PM 40 second phone call with Sheriff Mike Smith (Utah County)

  Mike Smith is present at press conference

  Retired deputy drives Tyler and his parents to the Washington County Sheriff's
  office.

  ~8:35 PM Tyler waits in a room for 2.5 hours without being interviewed.

  2.5 hours from this point would be ~11PM

  9:25 PM OFFICIAL "33 HOUR" MARK

  The official "first" arrest time recorded on the inmate booking sheet by State
  Bureau of Investigation (SBI) officer Arresting officer was in Utah County
  (~3.5 hours away)... would've had to leave by AT LEAST 6:30pm to arres

  Brian Davis at the Washington County office // "Arrest Agency: Other... Arrest
  Location: Outside Utah County"

  TR @ 10pm in Washington County

  Sept 12

  1:58 AM TR officially booked into system at Washington County

  4:00 AM TR is formally arrested with Utah County

  6:03 AM Trump announces on Fox & Friends... suspect in custody; found out 5min
  before show

  7:00 AM Press conference with Patel and Cox scheduled to start, delayed to
  7:30

  7:18 AM Utah County Probable Cause entered in system

  7:50 AM Press conference delayed again

  7:52 AM Press conference with Patel and Cox officially starts

  7:58 AM TR officially booked into Utah County system

  Gov Cox announces "We got him", names TR and reads probable cause affidavit
  verbatim, discussing evidence,

  cannot confirm if TR is cooperating with authorities; "There is one person
  responsible for what happened here,

  and that person is now in custody and will be charged soon"

  Why would law enforcement wait almost an entire day after getting custody, and
  10 hours after publicly

  8:15 AM announcing him as the official suspect, before even speaking with him?

  6:25 PM Kosh Patel press conference?

  Possible time of Miranda Rights? Doesn't make sense... 10 hours AFTER Gov Cox
  and getting custody, and 10

  hours after publicly announcing him as the official suspect, before even
  speaking with him?
